# Ant Design v6 — no deprecated props

Before writing or editing antd components, check the prop against its type
definition in `node_modules/antd/es/<component>/*.d.ts` and avoid anything marked
`@deprecated`. Prefer the replacement API.

## Known replacements (this project uses antd v6)

| Deprecated | Use instead | Components |
|------------|-------------|-----------|
| `maskClosable={false}` | `mask={{ closable: false }}` | Modal, Drawer |
| `destroyOnClose` | `destroyOnHidden` | Modal, Drawer, Tabs (`destroyInactiveTabPane`) |
| `bordered` / `bordered={false}` | `variant="outlined"` / `variant="borderless"` | Card, Select |
| `bodyStyle` / `headStyle` / `maskStyle` | `styles.body` / `styles.header` / `styles.mask` | Card, Modal, Drawer |
| `dropdownRender` | `popupRender` | Select |
| `dropdownClassName` / `dropdownStyle` | `classNames.popup.root` / `styles.popup` | Select |
| `onDropdownVisibleChange` | `onOpenChange` | Select |
| `dropdownMatchSelectWidth` | `popupMatchSelectWidth` | Select |
| `showArrow` | `suffixIcon` (`null` to hide) | Select |

Note: `bordered` is NOT deprecated on `List`, `Table`, or `Descriptions` — leave those.

## Examples

```tsx
// BAD
<Modal maskClosable={false} destroyOnClose bodyStyle={{ padding: 0 }} />
<Card bordered={false} />
<Select dropdownRender={render} onDropdownVisibleChange={fn} />

// GOOD
<Modal mask={{ closable: false }} destroyOnHidden styles={{ body: { padding: 0 } }} />
<Card variant="borderless" />
<Select popupRender={render} onOpenChange={fn} />
```

When unsure, grep the component's `.d.ts` for `@deprecated` and confirm the
suggested replacement rather than guessing.
